    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"
keywords:
  - Riordan arrays
  - partially ordered sets
  - poset enumeration
  - binary matrices
  - combinatorics
  - graph isomorphism
abstract: >-
  Header-only C++20 library and tools for Riordan posets: posets whose order
  relation is a binary Riordan matrix. Includes tree enumeration of all Riordan
  poset matrices, canonical forms and large-scale counting of Riordan posets up to
  isomorphism (verified values for n <= 28), recognition of Riordan posets, Toeplitz
  and exponential Riordan posets, and an exact decision procedure for infinite
  Riordan posets with rational generating functions.
